Adds gesture momentum to the transform, so that SDKs on top of the engine
stop each building their own fling, friction, and bearing snap
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1705). Each part of a
momentum starts at its release speed and slows by friction or by Android's
scroll spline. On a tilted map, a pan glides the same distance on screen in
every direction.

